          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 59647,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When can we use <code>console.log()</code> to display the value of a variable?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">After we create the variable</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Before we create the variable</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Before or after we create the variable</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">After we create the variable.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>You put <code>console.log(city)</code> before creating <code>city</code> with <code>const</code>. Which change displays its stored value?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Move <code>console.log(city)</code> after creating <code>city</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Put quotes around <code>city</code> inside <code>console.log()</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Rename only <code>city</code> inside <code>console.log()</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Move <code>console.log(city)</code> after creating <code>city</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 59648,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why is this not a string value?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"New York\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Because there are no double quotes around it</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Because there's a space between the words</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Because the words are capitalized</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Because there are no double quotes around it.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which change turns the shown <code>New York</code> into a string value?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"New York\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Wrap <code>New York</code> in double quotes</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Remove the space between <code>New</code> and <code>York</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Change both words to lowercase</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wrap <code>New York</code> in double quotes.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 59668,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code the <code>=</code> sign to give the <code>spaceship</code> variable the string value <code>\"Enterprise\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" spaceship = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Enterprise&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 6",
            "id": 59670,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Display <code>Atlanta</code> in the console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Atlanta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Atlanta\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Atlanta\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>console.log</code> followed by <code>(</code> and then <code>\"Atlanta\"</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Print the string <code>Atlanta</code> to the console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Atlanta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.error\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.warn\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Atlanta\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Atlanta\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>console.log</code>, followed by <code>(</code>, <code>\"Atlanta\"</code>, and finally <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
