          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 59764,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" income = \" /><text value=\"1400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" savings = \" /><text value=\"900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"savings = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"income = \" /><text value=\"1500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(savings);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1000\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1000</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1500</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>900</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>1000</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why does the final <code>console.log(savings)</code> display the value it does?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" income = \" /><text value=\"1400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" savings = \" /><text value=\"900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"savings = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"income = \" /><text value=\"1500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(savings);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1000\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It displays <code>1000</code> because that value replaced <code>900</code> in <code>savings</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It displays <code>1500</code> because that is the last value assigned anywhere</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">It displays <code>900</code> because a variable keeps its first value</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It displays <code>1000</code> because that value replaced <code>900</code> in <code>savings</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 5",
            "id": 59768,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Display <code>goal</code> minus <code>milesRan</code> in the console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" goal = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" milesRan = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Miles left: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(goal - milesRan);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Miles left: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>goal</code>, followed by <code>-</code>, and finally <code>milesRan</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>After the label, print how many miles remain from <code>goal</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" goal = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" milesRan = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Miles left: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(goal - milesRan);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Miles left: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>goal</code>, followed by <code>-</code>, and finally <code>milesRan</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 7",
            "id": 59770,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Display the value of <code>total</code> in the console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"1084\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = score + bonus;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"86\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1584\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>total</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 8",
            "id": 59771,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Set <code>total</code> to the result of <code>score</code> minus <code>penalty</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"1084\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" penalty = \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = score - penalty;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"584\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>score</code>, followed by <code>-</code>, and finally <code>penalty</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use <code>score</code> and <code>penalty</code> to make <code>total</code> store the remaining score <code>584</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"1084\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" penalty = \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = score - penalty;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"total\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"584\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>score</code>, followed by <code>-</code>, and finally <code>penalty</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 59767,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What's the value of <code>number3</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number1 = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number2 = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number3 = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"number3 = number1 + number2;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>7</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>10</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>7</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>After the last line runs, which value does <code>number3</code> store, and why?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number1 = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number2 = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number3 = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"number3 = number1 + number2;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>7</code>, because <code>3 + 4</code> replaces its previous value</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>10</code>, because reassignment cannot replace an existing value</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code>, because only the second operand is stored</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>7</code>, because <code>3 + 4</code> replaces its previous value.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 62055,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which sign turns <code>true</code> into <code>false</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\" iscode=\"false\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\"><code>!</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>-</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>?</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>!</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which expression evaluates to <code>false</code> by reversing <code>true</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>!true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>-true</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>?true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>!true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
