            "id": 62039,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which value isn't a string?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\" iscode=\"false\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\"><code>true</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>\"true\"</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>\"wrong\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Your app is ready. Which special value should you store in <code>isReady</code> to show that?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"true\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 6",
            "id": 62073,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Can you make sure that <code>true</code> appears in the console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" loggedIn = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Logged in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(loggedIn);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"loggedIn = !\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Logged in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(loggedIn);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"133\" endIndex=\"141\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Logged in:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"false\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Logged in:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>loggedIn</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the last log so the second status reports the updated value.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" loggedIn = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Logged in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(loggedIn);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"loggedIn = !\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Logged in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(loggedIn);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"133\" endIndex=\"141\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!loggedIn\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Logged in:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"false\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Logged in:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>loggedIn</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
