            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Can you pick the snippet that displays <code>true</code> in the console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" split = \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" / \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(split);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Even split:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Even split:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Make the final console output the boolean <code>true</code>, not text that looks like it.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" split = \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" / \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(split);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Even split:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Even split:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
