            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What's the result of using the <code>===</code> operator?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">A value of either <code>true</code> or <code>false</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">A value of either <code>\"true\"</code> or <code>\"false\"</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">A numerical value</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A value of either <code>true</code> or <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What kind of value does the expression <code>8 === 8</code> produce?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The boolean value <code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The string value <code>\"true\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The number <code>8</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick The boolean value <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
